    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install omniget
```

Chocolatey downloads the official 64-bit installer at install time and runs it silently. The package itself carries no binaries.

Install a specific version:

```powershell
choco install omniget --version=<version>
```

## What is omniget?

A desktop downloader for course platforms, video, music and books, covering more than
1,800 sites. It is free and open source, and it runs as a window rather than a command
line, so there is nothing to type to fetch something.

Upstream also publishes a separate command line build, `omniget-cli`. This package
installs the desktop application.

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade omniget
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall omniget
```

